Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:0c40e95c7947a0ebf86a6900e696f425c6512b8f4cc2d64bdbe634c04ff4caa6","file":"preprints/An-atomic-certificate-for-triangular-lattice-universal-optimality-September-26-2026/build/main.tex","line":68,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"42101594a24ab6b068e1d190936878bb72062e0512daa83d72f3ba9e557bbb17","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/An-atomic-certificate-for-triangular-lattice-universal-optimality-September-26-2026/build/main.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:0c40e95c7947a0ebf86a6900e696f425c6512b8f4cc2d64bdbe634c04ff4caa6","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/An-atomic-certificate-for-triangular-lattice-universal-optimality-September-26-2026/build/main.tex#L68"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:universal}\nFor every smooth nonnegative completely monotone function $g$ on\n$(0,\\infty)$ and every locally finite planar set $\\mathcal C$ of centered\ndisk density one,\n\\[\n E_g(\\mathcal C)\\ge\n \\sum_{a\\in A\\setminus\\{0\\}}g(|a|^2)=E_g(A).\n\\]\nThe comparison and the equality are in the extended nonnegative reals."}
